// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
// TBI - Translation Buffer Invalidate (via MTPR to special IPR)
//
// This is typically invoked via:
//   MTPR Ra, DTB_IA (0xA3) - Invalidate all DTB entries
//   MTPR Ra, ITB_IA (0x83) - Invalidate all ITB entries
//   MTPR Ra, DTB_IS (0xA2) - Invalidate single DTB entry (VA in Ra)
//   MTPR Ra, ITB_IS (0x82) - Invalidate single ITB entry (VA in Ra)
//
// For simplicity, this file implements a TBIA (invalidate all) as a
// standalone instruction. The actual TLB invalidation is handled
// through special IPR writes in hw_mtpr.isa.
//
// This file defines the IPR addresses for TLB invalidation:

// IPR Addresses for TLB control:
// 0x82 = ITB_IS  (Invalidate Single ITB)
// 0x83 = ITB_IA  (Invalidate All ITB)
// 0xA2 = DTB_IS  (Invalidate Single DTB)
// 0xA3 = DTB_IA  (Invalidate All DTB)

// Note: Full TLB invalidation support requires extending hw_mtpr.isa
// to handle these IPR addresses. The invalidation clears valid bits
// in the TLB arrays.
